OL,3,GNEWSANew sites considered as part of
OL,4,Acouncil homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dorset council is lining up several
OL,7,Fnew sites for development as part of
OL,8,Fits first-ever local plan.
OL,10,FBCP (Bournemouth, Christchurch and
OL,11,FPoole) Council said it needed to find
OL,12,Fspace for 3,000 new homes a year
OL,13,Fbecause of government housing
OL,14,Frequirements.
OL,16,FIt said an up-to-date plan was intended
OL,17,Fto help the authority manage growth and
OL,18,Freduce the risk of unplanned
OL,19,Fdevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
